    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-fem-conduction-velocity-scaling-exponent-v-d-p-across-electrotonic-diffusivity-ablation-sweep> a schema:PropertyValue,
