    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula, coupled to a P1-FEM trigger-hair action potential and Ca2+ counting gate — Morphometric validation: 72/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1680-1873) now returns 17 measurements. The genuinely validating ones are the FEM-vs-exact-Nagumo strip speed (9.55 vs 9.80 cm/s, measurement 10), the diffusivity exponent 0.496 vs 0.5 (12), and the emergent FEM-vs-0-D threshold elevation (14); the lobe speed 8.35 cm/s (11) and AP duration 1.55 s (13) land in the recalled literature ranges. Deductions: measurements 3-6 report r = 1.0000 / RMSE = 0.0000 against `*_obs` columns produced by the same analytic/ODE model (circular) and Panel C labels them \"Forterre et al. (2005) ref\" (L1316) (-10); measurements 8-9 compare with self-recorded values (L1776, L1786) (-5); measurement 14 (F_min 3.00 vs 2.9 µN) is parameter-driven because `TRIGGER_HAIR_F_HALF_UN` = 2.9 (L683) is set at the literature threshold, and measurement 17 (24.8 s) is fixed by `CA_INCREMENT_PER_AP`/`CA_DECAY_TAU_S` (L696-697) — the self-test checks sweep/analytic consistency, not the literature 30 s (-6); the latency reference 0.3 s (16) is soft and dominated by the inherited `tau_active` = 0.18 s (-3); all new reference values are `literature-approx`, not digitised figures (-4)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py L1316–L1317: Panel C legend labels model-generated points 'Forterre et al. (2005) ref'; Stage II shading hard-coded 0.21-0.30 s <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/de27b685/2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py#L1316-L1317>",
            "2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py L1722–L1760: Measurements 3-6: r = 1.0000 against *_obs columns generated by the same model (circular) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/de27b685/2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py#L1722-L1760>",
            "2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py L683–L700: Model constants (F_half = 2.9 µN, D, tau_v, c_Ca, tau_Ca) chosen so threshold, speed and memory window land in the recalled literature ranges <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/de27b685/2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py#L683-L700>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-bistable-equilibrium-curvature-kappa-eq-alpha-kappa-init-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-coupled-2d-snap-peak-speed-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-cusp-catastrophe-saddle-node-fold-locus-kx0-fold-alpha-kappa-init-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-dionaea-muscipula-specimen-bilateral-lobe-symmetry-index-across-central-midrib-dionaea-muscipula-trap-lobe-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-dionaea-muscipula-specimen-marginal-cilia-tooth-angular-spacing-cv-dionaea-muscipula-trap-lobe-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-fem-action-potential-half-amplitude-duration-at-lobe-probe-nodes>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-fem-conduction-velocity-scaling-exponent-v-d-p-across-electrotonic-diffusivity-ablation-sweep>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-fem-lobe-action-potential-conduction-velocity-from-trigger-hair-across-dionaea-lobe-planform>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-flat-pass-gaussian-stretching-energy-barrier-u-stretch-0-0-at-adult-alpha-3-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-forterre-et-al-2005-critical-cusp-catastrophe-coupling-threshold-alpha-c-nu-0-28>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-p1-fem-planar-action-potential-conduction-velocity-vs-exact-nagumo-front-speed-strip-benchmark>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-single-touch-one-action-potential-final-shell-curvature-kappa-x-kappa-init-no-closure-control>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-surgical-curvature-relief-strip-ablation-energy-barrier-delta-u-l-eff-l-3>,
